<title>USA: Iomega names strategy director from NEC.</title>
<headline>Iomega names strategy director from NEC.</headline>
<dateline>ROY, Utah 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iomega said Friday it had named as its director of strategic business development Shun Kaneko, a pioneer in the Japanese data storage products industry.</p>
<p>Kaneko joins Iomega after retiring from NEC Corp, where he worked for 35 years and was most recently the chief engineer of NEC's Computer Group. He was also on the board of NEC Ibarki, NEC's data storage unit, Iomega said.</p>
<p>He served as chairman of the International Disk Drive Equipment and Materials Association (IDEMA) in Japan since 1992, the company said.</p>
